agic accident ended his life at 20, but it didn't end his ability to help those in need. Michael was a registered donor and his organs went on to save others. His family honors his legacy by volunteering in support of donation. |\n\nJackie Lerma Billings |\n\nBorn in England but raised near San Diego, Jackie Lerma Billings"
