ss Artemis, forcing him to sacrifice his daughter in order to make things right. In The film, a doctor's children start to become incredibly ill, and the son of a patient that died under the doctor's operation warns him that he must kill one member of his family, or else they'll all die. Director Yorgos Lanthimos gave the myth a medical twist and delivered a thrilling moral dilemma. The film uses dead"
