he opposite of rebellious when I was a teen,\" Stefani told Sweety High in 2017. \"I was very peaceful and easy and passive. I always had that one friend and I discovered music. Kind of like everybody, when you find that music that defines who you are, you kind of relate to it.\"\n\nJulia Louis-Dreyfus did theater in high school.\n\nWhile the \"Veep\" star was in"
