private boarding school in Concord, Massachusetts. He was one of several celebrities to appear in an Annual Fund giving video appeal in 2009 for Oakwood School, which many thought would go viral, but only earned about 38,255 views (which is still awesome, but just not as awesome as they had hoped).\n\nGlenn Close\n\nThe famous actress attended Choate Rosemary Hall, a boarding and day school in Connecticut. She is in good company among Choate alumni, some of whom include Michael Douglas, Jamie Lee Curtis,"
