ralization. This type of citizenship only applies if you've never obtained Korean nationality in the past, and if you have no Korean family relations. To apply, you'll need to meet all of the following criteria:\n\n- Be at least 20 years old\n\n- Have an Alien Registration Card\n\n- Have a Korean address on file\n\n- Be eligible to work in South Korea\n\n- Be of good conduct \u2013 you'll be ineligible for citizenship if you have a criminal record\n\n- Be able to maintain a living on your own (or you may be a dependent member of a"
